{"id":"f22350be65138e0e","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-top4-perfect-map.md","title":"ZFC Top4 Perfect Map","display":"df-zfc-top4-perfect-map — ZFC Top4 Perfect Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top4-perfect-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top4-perfect-map"],"display":"df-zfc-top4-perfect-map — ZFC Top4 Perfect Map","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-top2-closed-map.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top4-perfect-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top4-perfect-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top4-perfect-map — ZFC Top4 Perfect Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"44867449c3df728b\" href=\"?note=44867449c3df728b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"484e951b19c4c192\" href=\"?note=484e951b19c4c192\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-top2-closed-map.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-top2-closed-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"67cf48a2f6e27861\" href=\"?note=67cf48a2f6e27861\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ClosedMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ClosedMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"44867449c3df728b\" href=\"?note=44867449c3df728b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"484e951b19c4c192\" href=\"?note=484e951b19c4c192\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-top2-closed-map.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-top2-closed-map.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"67cf48a2f6e27861\" href=\"?note=67cf48a2f6e27861\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4PerfectMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop4PerfectMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop4PerfectMap}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ClosedMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(f^{-1}[\\{y\\}],X,\\tau_X).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop4PerfectMap}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ClosedMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(f^{-1}[\\{y\\}],X,\\tau_X).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A perfect map is a continuous closed map with compact point fibres, between validated topological spaces.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"44867449c3df728b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-top2-closed-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"484e951b19c4c192","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-top2-closed-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md","status":"resolved","id":"67cf48a2f6e27861","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"44867449c3df728b","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ClosedMap}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md]], [[../batch17/58-df-zfc-top2-closed-map.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-top2-closed-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"484e951b19c4c192","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ClosedMap}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md]], [[../batch17/58-df-zfc-top2-closed-map.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md","status":"resolved","id":"67cf48a2f6e27861","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ClosedMap}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4PerfectMap}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop4PerfectMap}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ClosedMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(f^{-1}[\\{y\\}],X,\\tau_X).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1760,"backlinks":[{"id":"4e6b89a03ebb0d88","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c27f87e6422a971f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-332","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top4-perfect-map]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3574","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-top4-perfect-map.md|58-df-zfc-top4-perfect-map]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","74086485fba8d86f","44867449c3df728b","484e951b19c4c192","67cf48a2f6e27861"]}